    {
      "id": "p0232-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Underta/e's English script contains many special lines of text that most players probably never see. A few of these special lines look like random, meaningless symbols when uncovered, but they're not meaningless at all. They simply use a computer font named \"Wingdings\" that contains nothing but symbols.",
        "raw": "Underta/e's English script contains many special lines of text that most players\nprobably never see. A few of these special lines look like random, meaningless\nsymbols when uncovered, but they're not meaningless at all. They simply use a\ncomputer font named \"Wingdings\" that contains nothing but symbols.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29513787,
          0.32916429,
          0.89561876,
          0.39480714
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29178011,
          0.32845,
          0.90003152,
          0.39587857
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          13,
          14,
          15,
          16
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "《Undertale》的英文剧本里有许多特殊文本，大部分玩家可能从未见过。其中一些看起来像是随机、无意义的符号，其实并非如此。它们只是用了名为 Wingdings 的电脑字体；这套字体里全是符号。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 1,
            "end": 10,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          }
        ]
      },
