    {
      "id": "p0232-b007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Most players will probably never encounter these special messages in Underta/e because they only appear under extremely rare conditions. In addition, these messages look like gibberish unless the player has a Wingdings conversion chart handy. Thus, it almost feels like these messages contain dark secrets intended to confuse the player.",
        "raw": "Most players will probably never encounter these special messages in\nUnderta/e because they only appear under extremely rare conditions. In\naddition, these messages look like gibberish unless the player has a Wingdings\nconversion chart handy. Thus, it almost feels like these messages contain dark\nsecrets intended to confuse the player.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29609143,
          0.48314286,
          0.89150018,
          0.56857143
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29178011,
          0.48242857,
          0.90003152,
          0.56964286
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          19,
          20,
          21,
          22,
          23
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "多数玩家可能永远不会在《Undertale》里遇见这些特殊消息，因为它们只在极其罕见的条件下出现。而且，除非手边恰好有 Wingdings 对照表，否则看起来就是一堆乱码。于是，它们仿佛藏着某种黑暗秘密，有意让玩家摸不着头脑。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 12,
            "end": 21,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          }
        ]
      },
      "annotations": [],
